   "abstract": "Roaring-bitmap inverted index access method with count(*) and GROUP BY pushdown",
   "description": "pg_lion adds the lion index access method: one compressed posting set of roaring-style containers per distinct key, serving bitmap scans for equality, IN lists and NULL tests, and a custom scan that answers count(*) with equality filters and GROUP BY from the posting sets plus the visibility map. pg_lion_citext adds an operator class for citext.",
